Package: simple-ca-lite
Architecture: any
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: Certificate commands of the simple-ca certificate authority
 simple-ca-lite keeps a root CA and its issuing CAs in a directory, issues and
 revokes certificates, publishes CRLs and encrypts or decrypts the private
 keys, with the ca, cert, crl and key commands of simple-ca. It has no HTTP
 server, no tokens and no embedded documentation.
 .
 Its CA directory is that of simple-ca, so either program works on it.
